  <p class="page-kicker">Head to head</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Sennheiser Momentum 4 vs Anker Soundcore Q30</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Two of the most-recommended ANC headphones in totally different price tiers. The Momentum 4 has better sound, better ANC, better build, and 60-hour battery. The Soundcore Q30 has credible ANC, decent sound, and 40-hour battery for one fifth of the price. Here is when the $280 upgrade is worth it and when it isn't.</p>

